# eBooks app repo structure allowlist (pre-commit guard).
# Bash case-glob patterns: * matches any characters INCLUDING slashes.
# Publishing a new book = add its books/<slug>/* line (and its .gitignore
# allowlist entry) in the same commit. Local-only books are intentionally
# absent from this file.
.repo-structure
.gitignore
index.html
server.py
shared/*
scripts/*
books/numbers/*
books/alphabet/*
